//RS 
//RS /// Card #2003 criterion 3 — one env owner, proved as a CROSS-TIER
//RS /// DIFFERENTIAL.
//RS ///
//RS /// PROVES: a `env.set` performed by the running program is visible, with the
//RS /// same value, to BOTH the decoding read (`env.get`) and the raw-by-name read
//RS /// behind an env-derived terminal fact (`io.terminal_width()` reads `COLUMNS`,
